{
  "name": "WF-06 - ICP Scoring",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WF-06 \u2014 ICP SCORING\n\nTRIGGER: After WF-05, status=RESEARCHED\nINPUT: companies, research, research_evidence, contacts (all fetched inside the python module, not by n8n)\nPROCESSING: Calls the Python API's /wf06/score endpoint (python/scoring/engine.py) \u2014 deterministic, NO AI call, implements docs/06-scoring-engine.md exactly. Also runs python/scoring/signal_matcher.py internally to derive pain_signals/buying_signals from evidence before scoring.\nOUTPUT: lead_scores row; companies.status -> QUALIFIED if total >= 65, else stays RESEARCHED (visible as tier C/DONT_CONTACT in dashboard)\nDB OPS: Insert lead_scores, update companies.status\nERROR PATH: Missing inputs (e.g. no contacts row) -> contactability_score=0, scoring proceeds with the rest, does not fail the whole run\n\nSetup: point every Supabase node's credential at your project, and set\nExecute Command nodes' working directory to the repo root (needs\n`pip install -r python/requirements.txt` done first, and SUPABASE_URL /\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY / GROQ_API_KEY set as\nenvironment variables n8n can see).",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        -120
      ],
      "id": "sticky-note-header",
      "name": "Workflow Contract (docs/13-n8n-architecture.md)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "10-59/30 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        80
      ],
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Every 30 min, offset +10"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "companies",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "notesInFlow": "Filter: status = 'RESEARCHED'. lead_scores has no unique constraint on company_id by design (re-scoring inserts a new history row, docs/06 \u00a74) \u2014 this query naturally won't re-select QUALIFIED companies since WF-06 already advanced them."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        80
      ],
      "id": "get_researched",
      "name": "Get RESEARCHED companies not yet scored",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Hooze Supabase"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        80,
        80
      ],
      "id": "Loop Over Rows",
      "name": "Loop Over Rows"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.PYTHON_API_URL }}/wf06/score",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Internal-Secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.PYTHON_API_SECRET }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"company_id\": \"{{ $json.id }}\"\n}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ],
      "id": "run_scoring",
      "name": "Run scoring engine.py",
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 30 min, offset +10": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get RESEARCHED companies not yet scored",
